    1. Pick 3 distinct colors for bg, lattice, marker.
    2. Choose cell_size in {3, 4}, num_h_lines in [3,4], num_v_lines in [4,5].
    3. Choose hole rectangle span (1-2 steps in rows, 1-2 steps in cols); pick which pair of lattice row/col indices form the 4 hole corners.
