    6. Scatter marker pixels randomly into cell interiors (density ~10-20% of cell area).
    7. Verify grid dimensions are 17-22 in each direction; pad/trim trailing cell strip if needed (rows/cols after last line can be 0 to cell_size).
    8. Output = inclusive crop inp[r0:r1+1, c0:c1+1] where (r0,c0)/(r1,c1) are hole positions.
